    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "About Scenario Verification",
      "id": "about",
      "intro": "Scenario Verification adalah modul penjaminan kualitas aturan (rule) di mana Anda dapat mensimulasikan eksekusi rule pendeteksian fraud menggunakan data transaksi historis dalam jendela waktu tertentu. Fitur ini membantu mendeteksi false positive, menghitung persentase alert yang terpicu, serta memvalidasi keakuratan logika rule sebelum di-deploy ke produksi.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Fungsi Scenario Verification",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Validasi Logika Rule:** Menguji apakah kondisi visual yang dirakit di Scenario Studio berjalan semestinya pada data transaksi riil.\n• **Analisis Dampak (Impact Analysis):** Mengetahui volume alert yang akan dihasilkan jika rule diaktifkan, guna menghindari beban kerja berlebih (alert fatigue) bagi tim investigator.\n• **Pengujian Bebas Risiko:** Eksekusi dilakukan di lingkungan sandbox yang aman tanpa memicu alert produksi atau memodifikasi status kasus aktif.\n• **Metrik Akurasi Terukur:** Menghasilkan statistik persentase data yang terpicu (Triggered) vs tidak terpicu (Not Triggered) secara instan.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(59,130,246,.1);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 60%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:20px 22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:16px 16px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.3px;\">Scenario Verification</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-top:3px;\">Rule Performance Simulation</div></div><div style=\"margin-left:auto;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Sandbox</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:16px 18px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;padding-top:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:6px;\">Simulation Metrics</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);border:1px solid #22c55e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">● Triggered %</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.1);border:1px solid #eab308;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#ca8a04;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">● Execution Time</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);border:1px solid #6366f1;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">● Audit Log</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Daftar Simulasi (Main Layout)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Halaman utama menyajikan riwayat pengujian rule yang telah dilakukan.\n• Dilengkapi dengan toolbar atas yang interaktif:\n  - **View Toggle:** Beralih antara **Card View** (tampilan kartu visual dengan metrik grid) dan **Table View** (tampilan tabel data ringkas dengan detail panel kanan permanen).\n  - **Search:** Membuka panel kanan untuk memfilter riwayat pencarian berdasarkan status, tanggal, rule, atau pembuat.\n  - **Run Verification:** Membuka drawer form parameter untuk mengeksekusi pengujian rule baru.\n  - **Pagination:** Mengontrol jumlah data yang dimuat per halaman (Page Size) dan navigasi halaman.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>Scenario Verification</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:6px;padding:2px;\"><div style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">Card</div><div style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Table</div></div><div style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">▶ Run Verification</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Verification #128</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Rule #17 • admin_sefis</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:end;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2.5px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3);border-radius:4px;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">COMPLETED</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">1000 txs</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Siklus Hidup & Status Eksekusi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setiap tugas simulasi yang dikirimkan masuk ke dalam antrean sistem dan memiliki status sebagai berikut:\n  - **QUEUE (Kuning):** Tugas berada dalam antrean penjadwalan transaksi database.\n  - **PROCESS / RUNNING (Biru):** Sistem sedang mengeksekusi mesin deteksi fraud pada sekumpulan data transaksi.\n  - **COMPLETED (Hijau):** Simulasi selesai dengan sukses dan statistik pemicu siap dianalisis.\n  - **FAILED (Merah):** Terjadi kesalahan selama proses simulasi (misalnya rule tidak valid atau koneksi DB terputus).",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.05);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">QUEUE</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#b45309;\">Tugas dalam antrean penjadwalan</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">PROCESS / RUNNING</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#1d4ed8;\">Mesin fraud sedang memproses data</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">COMPLETED</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#15803d;\">Simulasi selesai & metrik siap dianalisis</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fecaca;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">FAILED</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#b91c1c;\">Simulasi gagal akibat error internal</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
